000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TQ6SUB.
000600*REMARKS.        THIS PROGRAM SORTS AND PRODUCES A REPORT BY MAIN-
000700*                TENANCE-ZONE OF ALL 'OO' STATUS WORK-ORDERS  INI-
000800*                TIATED BUT NOT STARTED  WITHIN 24 HRS, ALL  'IP'
000900*                STATUS WORK-ORDERS STARTED BUT NOT COMPLETED  WI-
001000*                THIN 24 HRS AND ALL 'H ' STATUS WORK-ORDERS  (HA,
001100*                HL,HM,HS) NOT RELEASED WITHIN 24 HRS; THEIR PRIO-
001200*                RITY NUMBER, WORK-ORDER NUMBER, DESCRIPTION, STA-
001300*                TUS DATE AND TIME.
      *C
      *C  SEPTEMBER 1996  JE COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C               EXPANDED THE DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    AS400.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                      LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
002600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002700 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZINQUIRY-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
002900     SELECT IL-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-ILFILE
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
003000         ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
003100         RELATIVE KEY IS IL-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS IL-STATUS.
003500     SELECT OUT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-OUTFILQ6
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
003600         ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
003700         RELATIVE KEY IS ACT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS OF-STATUS.
003200     SELECT SM-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-SMFILE
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
003300         ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
003400         RELATIVE KEY IS SM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS SM-STATUS.
002800     SELECT SORT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
           SELECT WO-BASIC-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1002
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WBF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS ARG-NO
               FILE STATUS IS WLNU-STATUS.
